{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"746965729420509185","content":"Fae whistle(requires attunement by archfey patrons, chinnokin, elf, fey, half-elf, or jackalope)\nA handcrafted wooden whistle with growing leaves and vines. It holds up to 4 charges to use the following properties:\n\n1. Use an action attempting to charm a creature within 60 ft. Wisdon dc 15 (1 charge)\n\n2. Summon a single fey creature for up to 10 minutes as an action, the fey must be of a challenge rating equal to 1/3 of your level. You must concentrate on this conjuration as if concentratinf on a spell (2 charges)\n\n3. End a charm as an action, or reaction upon being charmed, on a creature who can hear the whistle within 30 ft by making a charisma check against the original save DC (1 charge)\n\nCharges can be limited or recharge at dawn","created_at":"2020-08-28T18:14:24.595000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-28T18:51:42.501000Z","id":"748968747603329127","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
